  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="81354263-95d4-5c6d-a6b8-dab162c0e736" activityNameId="72cf8b57-694d-5f75-b1df-27ed265d9d31" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">xx Grass from meadow intensive, organic, at field</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx Grass from meadow intensive, organic, at field
Refers to 1 kg dry matter of fresh gras from intensive organic production with 1.66 kg CO2  and 17.9 MJ per kg dry matter. The dry matter content of fresh gras is about 10-15%;
UUID: 9f6ebdd8-81eb-3cb6-a875-99af965b0633
The inventories include the cultivation of gras on a temporary meadow. Included steps are soil cultivation, fertilisation (cattle slurry and manure), harvest, loading for transport.
Location: Refers to a production in the Swiss plateau (lowlands &lt;700m).
Technology: Intensive organic production.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data were compiled from statistics, fertilising recommendations, documents from extension services and expert knowledge. 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_9f6ebdd8-81eb-3cb6-a875-99af965b0633.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
